{"title":"Football Stadium Turned Community Garden","link":"https://kottke.org/25/11/football-stadium-turned-community-garden","date":1763478759000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/taiwan-stadium-garden-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/taiwan-stadium-garden-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/taiwan-stadium-garden-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1796\" alt=\"a community garden in the stands of an old football stadium\" /></p>\n\n<p>As part of a city-wide urban greening program, Taipei turned an abandoned football stadium <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/reclaimedbynature/comments/1oarxwi/old_stadium_in_taipei_turned_into_an_allotment/\">into a community garden</a>. <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DRIXxIHkdJC/\">Here’s an overview of the terraced garden</a> that’s taken over Zhongshan Soccer Stadium from James Stewart on Instagram. A couple of screenshots from the video:</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/taiwan-stadium-garden-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/taiwan-stadium-garden-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/taiwan-stadium-garden-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1135\" alt=\"a community garden in the stands of an old football stadium\" /></p>\n\n<p>So cool! (thx, alaina)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/cities\">cities</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Taiwan\">Taiwan</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/11/football-stadium-turned-community-garden\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"d9d3a5c133b3237a5aa5ce4b6c21a66d2f5672e46f95d96c7a4db7c803bdc337","category":"Sites"}